{"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4348910/","dev":"Questing Goose Studio","pub":"tinyBuild","short":"《深空當鋪：可能是偷的》是一款以反烏托邦太空站為背景的賽博龐克商店經營模擬遊戲。製作、交易，並走私各種來路不明的商品，在各方派系之間周旋。為了維持生計，你願意突破多少底線？趁房租不斷飆漲、把你逼到走投無路之前，賺夠錢買下自己的店面吧。","plat":["win"],"ws":false,"img":{"hero":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/5c4503e62e9ff9d138d93d972ebd1fe62af114bc/library_hero.jpg?t=1795024727","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/837d8597c8e8f6c8f75c4b35fc435d780803a922/header.jpg?t=1795024727","wide":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/9c7b2a21040f0e71a412bc8347a357f8e26212a4/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1795024727","box":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/5cb0a6457762778c2c3bcaaa06768bb77cc791a8/library_capsule.jpg?t=1795024727","bg":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/c7ac4685d5bbae555b09f9e76d0bc2e99a90cea1/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1795024727"},"shots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/c3fd208d9830641a432822c2ffb762824980ce7b/ss_c3fd208d9830641a432822c2ffb762824980ce7b.jpg?t=1795024727","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/309930b942d4670222a3c94cff4d2c27a000bbb4/ss_309930b942d4670222a3c94cff4d2c27a000bbb4.jpg?t=1795024727","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/f60b54ed03b6d644bce610204ef44d7fbfa12b0f/ss_f60b54ed03b6d644bce610204ef44d7fbfa12b0f.jpg?t=1795024727","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/a7dd4e3d14b364c7b2f521745df813b19bd1dfff/ss_a7dd4e3d14b364c7b2f521745df813b19bd1dfff.jpg?t=1795024727","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/29a423c290e82503d25b8ff62c9982b8493f1147/ss_29a423c290e82503d25b8ff62c9982b8493f1147.jpg?t=1795024727","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea